 j, down         next record                                                    
 k, up           previous record                                                
 ctrl+d          half a pane down                                               
 ctrl+u          half a pane up                                                 
 pgdown          one pane down                                                  
 pgup            one pane up                                                    
 g, home         first loaded record                                            
 G, end          last loaded record                                             
 enter           open the selected record                                       
 a               open the selected record's author                              
 r               poll for new records, keep the place                           
 t               switch streams                                                 
 /               search records                                                 
 u               find people                                                    
 s               switch the search order                                        
 ?               show or hide this list                                         
 q, esc          back, or quit at the start                                     
 ctrl+c          quit now                                                       
 m               switch display mode                                            
 c               next display style                                             
 1               display style 1                                                
 2               display style 2                                                
 3               display style 3                                                
 4               display style 4                                                
 ctrl+p          switch to the idle screen                                      
 b               open the saved stream                                          
 l               open the starred stream                                        
 i               open selected record files                                     
 y               copy the record reference                                      
 o               open the record externally                                     
 f               records this one references                                    
 e               records referencing this one                                   
 v               verified records referencing this one                          
 M               files this record attached                                     
                 ~ 3 more keys than the pane can show                           
session expired  copy the cookie again  queue=ci  200 requests, 12 rate-limited 